.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH orbweaver-scan 1  "scan " 
.SH NAME
scan \- 🔍 Discover repositories under a root, extract evidence, and save a snapshot
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBscan\fR [\fB\-\-root\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-commits\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
🔍 Discover repositories under a root, extract evidence, and save a snapshot
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-root\fR \fI<ROOT>\fR [default: .]
Directory to scan for repository candidates (one level deep)
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-commits\fR \fI<MAX_COMMITS>\fR [default: 20000]
Cap on git commits walked per repository
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
